@host = https://localhost:7185
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ENTRA_ACCESS_TOKEN
@rangeId = REPLACE_WITH_RANGE_ID
@phoneId = REPLACE_WITH_PHONE_ID

GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Create a range (admin); creates all three phone numbers in the same transaction.
POST {{host}}/v1/ranges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Example range",
  "description": null,
  "rangeStart": "+4512345600",
  "rangeEnd": "+4512345602",
  "mainLine": null,
  "active": true,
  "provider": "Example provider",
  "type": "DirectRouting",
  "voiceRoute": "sbc.example.invalid",
  "netboxSiteId": null
}

### Availability is a query; POST a reservation to claim a number.
GET {{host}}/v1/phonenumbers/getnextavailable?rangeId={{rangeId}}&amount=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reserve an available number (write/admin).
POST {{host}}/v1/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reservedFor": "system",
  "reason": "Capacity planning",
  "phoneNumberId": "{{phoneId}}",
  "system": "Other",
  "expires": null,
  "ticketNumber": "TASK-123"
}
